      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/b3f665/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-01-10T03:54:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well that makes my order of the promos pointless. I have just wasted money left and right this year. Ordered a couple days to early for the winter sale so I could have something for Hanukkah (paid full price for mister chomps and shipping). Tried to get in touch to see if I could get my order switched or at least get the promos. Got no response so ended up ordering just the promos and paid for shipping on that. Oh well. I don't regret ordering the products, I just hate the feeling I am getting penalized because the rules keep changing.</p>",
